-- title:
--   Positive original UBV source witnesses suffice for all capped and unrestricted values including zero reserve
-- statement:
--   For the unchanged original UBV Levy model, source-exact measurable positive-integer clipped ruin-clock W, cash, terminal and centred signed martingale/drift evidence need be supplied only for strictly positive initial reserves. The previously Proved LIMIT-1 positive source-to-perpetual theorem yields each positive reserve dividendValue bound via nonnegative terminal budgets and the exact full-Stieltjes limit. The independently Proved zero-reserve branch closes x=0, including its right-payment atom. The positive-and-zero value adapter yields all capped and, at C=top, unrestricted valueFunction bounds. No source stochastic proof, ruin mass cancellation, equality-in-law, terminal vanishing or extra HJB generator assumption is introduced.

import Mathlib.Analysis.Calculus.ContDiff.Defs
import Mathlib.Analysis.Complex.Exponential
